OL,4,CDrug-driving arrest after lorry crash  
OL,5,Cshuts road                             
OL,6,GA man has been arrested on suspicion   
OL,7,Gof drug-driving after a lorry left the 
OL,8,Groad and crashed closing the A36 in    
OL,9,GHampshire.                             
OL,11,FNational Highways said the road is     
OL,12,Fshut in both directions between the    
OL,13,FA3090 near Ower and the A27 near       
OL,14,FWhiteparish after the HGV "overturned" 
OL,15,Fon Wednesday at about 16:00 GMT.       
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
