OL,4,CStudy shows 'economic and social       
OL,5,Cvalue' of concerts                     
OL,6,GA Dorset orchestra has published a new 
OL,7,Greport that it says shows its positive 
OL,8,Gimpact on communities across the South.
OL,10,FThe Bournemouth Symphony Orchestra     
OL,11,F(BSO), a registered charity, said it   
OL,12,Fhad generated #11.4m of economic value 
OL,13,Fand #17.8m of social value in 2025.    
OL,15,FIts study, which it said used Treasury 
OL,16,Fspending calculations, examines its    
OL,17,Fimpact on people in hospitals, care    
OL,18,Fhomes, concert halls, community        
OL,19,Fcentres and schools.                   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
