OL,4,CNile Rodgers and The Streets to        
OL,5,Cheadline Boomtown                      
OL,6,GNile Rodgers & Chic and The Streets    
OL,7,Ghave been announced as headliners for  
OL,8,Gnext year's Boomtown festival.         
OL,10,FThey lead the first wave of more than  
OL,11,F50 acts announced for the 2027 event,  
OL,12,Fwhich runs from 11 to 15 August at     
OL,13,FMatterley Estate near Winchester.      
OL,15,FThe Streets will play A Grand Don't    
OL,16,FCome For Free in full, followed by a   
OL,17,Fgreatest-hits set.                     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
